    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5358efa65a07a97282e48673",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你啊，别哭成这样。\n前几天的记者会上，\n富士大人不是表现得很坚强吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc189f7f6140711fb9312cbae9c0adc85db5925bc30ed577fb8f4cac32a48802",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
