    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203206e027a3eaed79f8d32b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会吧，太可惜了～富士奇石……\n难得大家都认为有机会能继成田白仁之后，\n连续两年看到三冠赛马娘诞生了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d34b9c2212aed215bf25db3a4e1dee24aab778995c1ed84654b53d19d9e39ceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
