    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a68e0a2887d06ee90bd380",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是说啊……但说真的，\n她本人才是最难过的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "abf42c22fb6fd4f705b16a26e1ab6a781efd60d2f98518be01baa49c9ace77c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ff6366da0dfce1bb7f10e9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至少一年没办法奔跑。\n不晓得能不能痊愈。\n也无法保证能恢复以前的状态──",
      "source_fingerprint": "187799afba38b0be59a3967d3d9b4fbe508814c873ff2d76ad8aa4d6bff3393d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2311ef19d2779f6109567ee2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是一颗散发耀眼光芒的巨星，\n因此她所留下的阴影，\n将世界垄罩在深深的黑暗之中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f6a4f1072954df6365cc4db91a428c5ebd1d0763b637dd09a84d33f9e86efb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1abf2b706aac40189704da1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（赛马娘很少啊……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "59459de3ee3eb071f9b39b123e0231c1c6e345b889e1745e4479d04f22a0619f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055115.json",
      "json_path": [
